@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. 회원 등록 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"김학생","email":"student@example.com","role":"student"}

### 2. 작업 등록 (회원 id=1 가정)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_id":1,"title":" 과제 제출 ","priority":"high","due_date":"2026-12-01","internal_note":"관리자 메모"}

### 3. 작업 응답에서는 internal_note 제외
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1

### 4. 회원별 필터
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?owner_id=1&done=false

### 5. PATCH 부분 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"done":true}

### 6. 잘못된 값은 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"owner_id":1,"title":"","done":"yes"}

### 7. 중복 이메일은 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"다른 학생","email":"student@example.com"}

### 8. 삭제 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1